ragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サイリウム持ってきてくれた方"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のりがよくて最高だーい‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日の午前中には"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島城と原爆ドームを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見に行ってきたよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"教科書の写真でしか見たことの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかったものを自分の目でちゃんと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見るのとでは多違いでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"衝撃が強くて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんな戦争は2度とおこって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほしくないです(´;ω;`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島城は木造でできていたのに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても感動しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名前だけ知っていただけなので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どういうものか分からなかったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見れてよかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして広島の皆さんやっと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂ってどこ⁈が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎週金曜25:25～広島ホームテレビ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でやることになりました‼やったー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひぜひチェックするしか～(´･ω･`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして運営ブログに載っている写真の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなりんとせいらりんとあたし。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれはかなりんブログにも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"描いてあるのですが変なことを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"している最中のあたし達ですw"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リズムに乗った自己紹介を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"作り上げたのです‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんとものの3分で←え"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愉快だ。素晴らしく愉快です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/09/4033542/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あなたのハートを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くだーさいとうゆうり←え"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たんたんたん ゆったんたん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"_"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-6731":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は乃木坂結成一周年目の日。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂４６一歳のお誕生日おめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/21/5525294/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてめざましライブに来てくださった皆さんありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブに関してはまだまだ学んでいますが、ライブってこんなに楽しくて、感動して、みんなとひとつになれるものなんだと感じました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんに会うと安心する！目が合うと照れちゃう(//∀//)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとステージに出る前に今までの事を思い出して泣きそうになり..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結果泣いてしまった〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だってね自分なりに頑張ってきた一年間。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂になって、メンバーに出会って、ふぁむの皆さんに出会って私は確実に変わることが出来ました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明るく、前向きに、あと女の子らしくなったかな〜なんてね(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんな思いがあふれでてくるよっ!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キャー(／▽＼)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よしっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気持ちを切り替える!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二年目に向けて、私は進み続ける。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"坂を上り続ける。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分に負けない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分らしくを大切に。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ネガティブになると思いますが、自分で切り替えられるように!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも時々皆さんのお世話になると思いますが"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/21/5525294/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうぞよろしくお願いいたします!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うたた寝でもしようかな〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/21/5525294/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"椅子と私。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ!!"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-12798":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんわーすー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握の詳細が発表されてましたが...\nレーン抽選ですねー♪どきどき。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はtypeB「扇風機」！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダー楽曲ですっ\nレゲエ調ってゆーんですかね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガルルとはまた違った\n夏ソングになってます( ^ω^ )\n扇風機に向かって あー ってしたくなる曲！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レコーディングの時は私たちも\n扇風機の向こうにマイクあって\nあー ってやったんだよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MVはねー雨にうたれたりしたんだけど\nもうね結構冷たかったでっすっんふふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛未とボール遊びしてたりするので\nよかったらさがしてみてー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーそれから台所で宿題もしてますー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんてね鉛筆の持ち方おかしいんだけど\nカメラ回ってる間はちょっと意識して\n直してみたりしたんだよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっそうそう、\n今回MVでは初のフロントポジションを\nつとめさせていただきましたっ( ;ω; )！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"万理華とかあしゅりーとかるんるんとか\nめちゃめちゃ喜んでくれて。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあライブパフォーマンスの時は\nまたちょっと違ったりするんですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえずいつもより\n写していただいてると思うので( ;ω; )\nみてねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/05/2318990/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回は大図鑑の説明を\nすっかり省きました(´・ω・｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん大図鑑とは何か。それは、いわゆる\n「過去の質問返しをまとめたもの」って\n感じかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"過去なので時制とかおかしなことになる質問も\n中にはあるかもだけど、\nま、そゆことなんでねー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/05/2318990/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1071"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/05/2318990/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2ndにもメンバーの映像が入るってほんと?\n運営さんはうそなんかつきません(^ω^)!斯うご期待!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1072"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/05/2318990/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの家族はみんなシーフード無理なん??それともひめたんだけ??\nひめたんだけだねー。\nままはシーフード大好きなのにアレルギーなの('・・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1073"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/05/2318990/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"47都道府県の中で、どこに行ったことありますか?どこの県が好きですか?\n千葉、埼玉、東京、神奈川、静岡、愛知、富山、滋賀、大阪、京都、岡山、鳥取、島根、山口、福岡。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1074"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/05/2318990/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3年生の担任はどんな人でしたか?\n体育科の女の先生!\n今でもたまに連絡してくれます。\n活動したり東京で受験したり、中元さん面倒な生徒だったんですよね。\nでも最後まで支えてくれた素敵な先生です☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1075"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/05/2318990/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問したらどのくらいたったら答えてくれるの??\nう...ごめんなさい...。\nできるだけタイムリーに答えられるよう努めます(ノω・`)しばしお待ちをー☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1076"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/05/2318990/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめかの名前の由来ってなんですかーーっ!\n1077"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/05/2318990/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日芽香の名前の由来は?\n1078"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/05/2318990/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日芽香ってご両親がどういった思いがあったのかぁと...\n1079"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/05/2318990/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日芽香と名付けたのは誰ですか?由来を教えて下さい\nひめたんが生まれた日の病院の窓から見た景色\n◎日　暖かいお日様\n◎芽　桜の花びらからのびる新芽\n◎香　風に散る桜の花の香り\nのような女の子に育ちますようにという意味が込められているそうです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まま、ありがとーうっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1080"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/05/2318990/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同じ誕生日のひめたん、その日は誰と誕生日を過ごしますか?\nわーおめでとうございます!\nひめたんは学校にも行くしめんばーにも会う予定。\nお互いにとって素敵な日になりますように☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1081"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/05/2318990/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみみのモノマネって前にミタパンブーでやってたやつだよね!\n大阪の個握でリクエストしていい?\nんー正確に言うとね、あみあみ(能條愛未chan)がひめたんの物真似をするんだけどね(ω)♪\nこの前の撮影の時は「ひめたんの物真似をするあみあみの物真似」をしたの。それ今度やりましょか(^^)??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1082"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/05/2318990/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1日だけ他のアイドルになれるとしたらどこのグループになってみたい\nももクロZさん!\n脳震盪起こすくらいに踊り狂ってみたい!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1083"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/05/2318990/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同い年な人ってどう??ww\n勝手に親近感(*^^*)ふふふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1084"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/05/2318990/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次の個別でやってみたい髪型とかある?\nどうしよかなー(ω)考えてなかった。いっつもその日の気分だからなー。何かリクエストありますかー??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1085"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/05/2318990/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"休みの日は何してるの?\nお散歩、読書、ぶろぐの質問まとめ、こんなかんじですかね(∀)☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1086"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/05/2318990/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近観たい映画あるのかな?\n最近ゆーか前からずっとなんだけど、ひめたん3Dメガネかける映画見たことないんよ!\n時代に置いてかれるーいややぁ(ノω;`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1087"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/05/2318990/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンレ出したいんだけど、特別に書き足して欲しいこととかあるかな??\n1088"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/05/2318990/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ握手したことないけどお手紙書いてもいい?\nお手紙好きよ＼(^O^)／中身はおまかせいたしますよ♪♪\n中身?お弁当みたいなニュアンスね。\nちゃんと読むけーね。\n今度いつ会社行くかわからんけちょっと時間かかるかもだけどちゃんと読むけ。ありがとーう!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/himeka.nakamoto/img/2013/07/05/2318990/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コウモリよ 歌い分けどこー？って\nコメントがたくさんありましたが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当ててみてー♪るん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(＊´・ω・＊)"}],"source":"archive"}}